            <div class="cert-item">ISO 14001:2015 – Environmental Management System (EMS) Certification</div>
            <div class="cert-item">ISO 45001:2018 – Occupational Health &amp; Safety (OH&amp;S) Management System Certification</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="certs-grid">
        <div class="cert-card">
            <h3>Quality Management System</h3>
