            <img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1-721x1024.png" alt="ISO 9001:2015 Certificate" loading="lazy"/>
            <a href="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/APTUS-CERT-9001-COPY-1.pdf" class="btn-download" target="_blank">Download Certificate</a>
        </div>

        <div class="cert-card">
            <h3>Occupational Health &amp; Safety</h3>
            <div class="cert-standard">ISO 45001:2018</div>
            <img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/2-721x1024.png" alt="ISO 45001:2018 Certificate" loading="lazy"/>
            <a href="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/APTUS-CERT-45001-COPY.pdf" class="btn-download" target="_blank">Download Certificate</a>
        </div>

        <div class="cert-card">
            <h3>Environmental Management System</h3>
            <div class="cert-standard">ISO 14001:2015</div>
            <img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/3-721x1024.png" alt="ISO 14001:2015 Certificate" loading="lazy"/>
            <a href="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/APTUS-CERT-14001-COPY.pdf" class="btn-download" target="_blank">Download Certificate</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom-text">
        <p>Aptus Infotech is dedicated to upholding top-tier international standards in quality (ISO 9001:2015), environmental management (ISO 14001:2015), and occupational health &amp; safety (ISO 45001:2018), with processes rigorously certified and globally recognized. This ensures enhanced customer satisfaction, improved efficiency, reduced environmental impact, regulatory compliance, better workplace safety, and a stronger reputation for businesses partnering with us.</p>
    </div>
</div>

    <section class="contact-form-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Have questions? We can help</h2>
            <div class="subtitle">Our experts can help you find the right solutions for your business.</div>
            <form class="contact-form" action="/contactus" method="post">
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>First Name *</label>
                        <input type="text" name="first_name" required="required"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Last Name *</label>
                        <input type="text" name="last_name" required="required"/>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Email *</label>
                        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="name@mail.com" required="required"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label>Phone *</label>
                        <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="e.g, +968 0000 0000" required="required"/>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Message</label>
                    <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Message"/>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Submit Now</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>
</div></div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </t>
</t>
